  "description": "Ten SOS workbooks (PBA..PBJ), one per claim, each delivering one variable (VA..VJ). PBJ delivers VJ open-ended from 2020 with an open 2019- block (00 Original, undated blank Missing). The others deliver theirs over 2019-2021, and each Kodlista states a dated 2019-2020 block (00 Original, then the undated 2-3 Range token and blank No type) followed by a dated 2021 block (00 Later meaning, undated blank Later missing meaning). A blank period is a year-independent row.",
